  "content_description": "Action Item - Teams",
  "content_text_body": "The objective here is for the team to understand the goals they have been given so that they can execute on them.\n\n### Clarify team goals\n\nReach out to your team leader or manager to get clarification on every goal set for the team. Spend time talking about the scope, duties, deadlines, and objectives of each goal until you have a shared understanding. Write these goals down, or log them in a task tracking tool, so that the entire team can understand the team goals, monitor progress, and note both successes and failures to meet these goals.\n\n### Repeat with each new goal\n\nWork together to replicate this process each time a new goal is set for the team.",
